<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>9.</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">梦想许愿</SPAN></B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：学生经过红毯，到“心愿墙”签名祝愿，并绕场返回原集合地，等待集体宣誓。（<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><I style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal">背景音乐</I></B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><I style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN></I></B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
